---
---

<section id="work" class="py-24 md:py-36 border-b border-black/[0.08] dark:border-white/[0.1]">
  <header class="max-w-2xl mb-16 space-y-3">
    <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3.5 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-semibold bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/30">
      02 / Production Work Experience
    </span>
    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-50 mt-2">
      Engineered under enterprise delivery pressure.
    </h2>
    <p class="text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
      Frontend platform architecture, verified performance speedups, and resilient distributed services.
    </p>
  </header>

  <!-- Timeline Rail Architecture -->
  <div class="relative pl-6 md:pl-10 border-l border-zinc-300 dark:border-zinc-800 space-y-12">
    
    <!-- Role 1: BFI Finance (Active Station) -->
    <div class="relative group">
      <!-- Terminal Node Marker -->
      <span class="absolute -left-[31px] md:-left-[47px] top-6 w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 ring-4 ring-white dark:ring-[#09090B] flex items-center justify-center">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-white dark:bg-zinc-950 animate-ping"></span>
      </span>

      <!-- Doppelrand Hardware Enclosure -->
      <div class="p-2 rounded-[2rem] bg-black/[0.03] dark:bg-white/[0.03] border border-black/[0.08] dark:border-white/[0.1] shadow-lg hover:border-emerald-500/40 transition-colors duration-500">
        <article class="p-6 sm:p-9 rounded-[calc(2rem-0.5rem)] bg-white dark:bg-zinc-950 shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.12)] space-y-6">
          <!-- Role Header -->
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800/80 pb-5">
            <div>
              <span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 font-semibold">
                ACTIVE_STATION // ENTERPRISE_CORE
              </span>
              <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-50 tracking-tight mt-1">
                Software Engineer, PT. BFI Finance Indonesia
              </h3>
              <p class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300 mt-0.5">
                Indonesia's largest multifinance enterprise · South Tangerang
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 self-start sm:self-auto">
              <span class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono font-medium bg-emerald-500/15 text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-500/30">
                Jan 2022 — Present
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Description -->
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200 leading-relaxed">
            Led frontend performance architecture across primary customer and operational surfaces. Implemented query deduplication, replaced unstable SSR with ISR pipelines, and modularized design foundations.
          </p>

          <!-- Verified Telemetry Metrics -->
          <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-900/80 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 space-y-1">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between font-mono text-xs">
                <span class="text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 font-bold">[97% LCP SPEEDUP]</span>
                <span class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">13.0s → 0.4s</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-xs text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200 leading-normal pt-1">
                Implemented ISR 60s revalidation and modular query schemas, cutting initial viewport render delays.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-900/80 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 space-y-1">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between font-mono text-xs">
                <span class="text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 font-bold">[50-60% API REDUCTION]</span>
                <span class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">10 → 2 req/page</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-xs text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200 leading-normal pt-1">
                Applied React.cache() deduplication across critical page endpoints, reducing backend payload overhead.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Technology Tags & Action Link -->
          <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
              <span class="px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-900 text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 rounded-md">
                React 19
              </span>
              <span class="px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-900 text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 rounded-md">
                Next.js ISR
              </span>
              <span class="px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-900 text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 rounded-md">
                FastAPI
              </span>
              <span class="px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-900 text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 rounded-md">
                React.cache()
              </span>
            </div>

            <a
              href="/work"
              class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 pl-4 pr-1.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-zinc-900 dark:bg-white text-white dark:text-zinc-900 text-xs font-mono font-semibold hover:bg-zinc-800 dark:hover:bg-zinc-100 transition-all duration-300 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.32,0.72,0,1)] active:scale-[0.98]">
              <span>View full case study</span>
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-white/20 dark:bg-black/10 flex items-center justify-center transition-transform duration-300 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.32,0.72,0,1)] group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <path d="M7 17L17 7"></path>
                  <path d="M7 7h10v10"></path>
                </svg>
              </span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Role 2: PT. Nusa Data Hexamatika -->
    <div class="relative group">
      <!-- Terminal Node Marker -->
      <span class="absolute -left-[31px] md:-left-[47px] top-6 w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-zinc-400 dark:bg-zinc-600 ring-4 ring-white dark:ring-[#09090B] flex items-center justify-center">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-white dark:bg-zinc-950"></span>
      </span>

      <!-- Doppelrand Hardware Enclosure -->
      <div class="p-2 rounded-[2rem] bg-black/[0.03] dark:bg-white/[0.03] border border-black/[0.08] dark:border-white/[0.1] shadow-lg hover:border-zinc-400 dark:hover:border-zinc-600 transition-colors duration-500">
        <article class="p-6 sm:p-9 rounded-[calc(2rem-0.5rem)] bg-white dark:bg-zinc-950 shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.12)] space-y-6">
          <!-- Role Header -->
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800/80 pb-5">
            <div>
              <span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 font-semibold">
                ARCHIVED_STATION // CLIENT_DELIVERY
              </span>
              <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-50 tracking-tight mt-1">
                Frontend Developer, PT. Nusa Data Hexamatika
              </h3>
              <p class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300 mt-0.5">
                Software Solutions Agency · Jakarta
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 self-start sm:self-auto">
              <span class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono font-medium bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-900 text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800">
                Jun 2021 — Dec 2021
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Description -->
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200 leading-relaxed">
            Engineered reusable UI component systems adopted across three customer platforms. Built five client marketing websites ensuring accessibility, cross-browser compatibility, and modular styling.
          </p>

          <!-- Impact Metrics -->
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-900/80 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 font-bold">
              [30% FEATURE ACCELERATION]
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300">
              Cut feature build time across three downstream projects.
            </span>
          </div>

          <!-- Technology Tags -->
          <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-900 text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 rounded-md">
              JavaScript
            </span>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-900 text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 rounded-md">
              Component Systems
            </span>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-900 text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 rounded-md">
              HTML5 / CSS3
            </span>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
